<title>ROMANIA: Romanian fertiliser maker net profit rises in 1996.</title>
<headline>Romanian fertiliser maker net profit rises in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's Azomures SA, a private fertiliser maker listed on the Bucharest bourse first tier, said on Tuesday its net profit rose to 72.63 billion lei last year from 14.18 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>(millions of lei unless stated)</p>
<p>				  Year to end-	Year to end-</p>
<p>				  Dec 96		Dec 95</p>
<p> Net profit		   72,631.71	  14,181.28</p>
<p> Dividend per share	    113.76 lei	 653 lei</p>
<p> Capital		     209,458.46	  168,540.87</p>
<p>NOTE: Data come from an Azomures report to the stock exchange. Bourse officials told Reuters they had provided the figures to brokers ahead of Tuesday's session but further details on assets, turnover or gross profit would be released later this month. Azomures officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>Azomures manufactures fertilisers and photographic materials.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
